<AddOnInstructionDefinition Use="Target" Name="I_EH_FlowmeterPromass100FW1" Revision="3.1" RevisionExtension="01 Release" Vendor="Rockwell Automation" ExecutePrescan="false" ExecutePostscan="false" ExecuteEnableInFalse="false" CreatedDate="2007-11-05T22:18:22.070Z" CreatedBy="Not Available" EditedDate="2014-09-03T20:38:12.171Z"
 EditedBy="PROCESS\Library" SoftwareRevision="v18.02">
<Description>
<![CDATA[E+H EtherNet/IP Promass 100 (FW1.x)]]>
</Description>
<RevisionNote>
<![CDATA[See V3.1-xx Release Notes for details. Unmodified, up-rev only for V3.1-01 public release.]]>
</RevisionNote>
<AdditionalHelpText>
<![CDATA[Copyright © Rockwell Automation, Inc.  All Rights Reserved.

This Instruction manages an E+H Promass 100 Flowmeter
with EtherNet/IP (with Firmware 1.x).  It:
  * Allows clearing the three totalizers
  * Makes available the Mass Flow, Mass Total, Volume Flow,
     and Volume Total of the stream

NOTE: This AOI is for use with meters with Version 1.x Firmware!
There is a separate AOI for use with Version 2.x Firmware.
]]>
</AdditionalHelpText>
